"stats.svp.note" = "Each round counts as it was played. \"Standardized putting\" adds your strokes gained back onto the card: the score the same long game would have shot with tour-average putting. Each band covers one standard deviation either side of that series' average. A narrower standardized band means your putting is what pulls the rounds apart; a wider one means they would differ regardless of the putter.";
"stats.svp.bandLegend" = "score average ± spread";
"stats.svp.bandLegendPro" = "standardized putting average ± spread";
"stats.svp.impactHigh" = "PUTTING DRIVES YOUR SCORE";
