"reference.intro" = "Two numbers, both measured against the PGA Tour average — but they answer different questions.";
"reference.sgText" = "Strokes gained judges a whole hole: the putts the tour would need from your first distance, minus the putts you actually took. A single putt has none of its own, because how good a lag was only shows once the hole is over.";
